@startuml
' Figure 27.3  Parallel research with merge (sequence)
' Reading order: top to bottom. The lead splits a desk question into
' two read-only questions that run at once; each worker returns an
' answer with citations; the lead merges, and the verifier checks each
' citation against the source. A failed citation goes to a person.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Lead" as L <<model>>
participant "Rules" as R <<model>>
participant "Waiver" as W <<model>>
participant "Verifier" as V <<verified>>
par
L -> R : Brief
R --> L : Cited answer
else
L -> W : Brief
W --> L : Cited answer
end
L -> L : Merge
L -> V : Merged answer
V --> L : Citations hold
V -[$FAIL]> L : Fails: to desk
@enduml
